exercises.stem:
分析以下代码，指出其中的错误并修正：
```java
class Cat {
    String name;

    void meow() {
        System.out.println(name + " is meowing!");
    }
}

Cat myCat;
myCat.meow();
```

exercises.answer:
错误在于 `myCat` 对象未初始化。修正后的代码如下：
```java
class Cat {
    String name;

    void meow() {
        System.out.println(name + " is meowing!");
    }
}

Cat myCat = new Cat();
myCat.name = "Whiskers";
myCat.meow();
```
